pe=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝血之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">帝血之力</font></span></span>]。每场战斗第一个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">断罪刃舞</span>]变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%B2%E5%8D%A1%E7%8E%9B%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/露卡玛尔\"><img alt=\"头像 露卡玛尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/28/lsl0basrl2u7cksj9pqv1h6xiziihdu.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">露卡玛尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style